---
// ContactForm.astro — LeadConnector enquiry form embed.
//
// HISTORY, kept because it explains why this file is watched closely:
// the original version ran a submit handler that called preventDefault(),
// logged the payload to the console, showed a success message and reset the
// form. Every enquiry was silently discarded while the visitor was told it
// had been sent — on a site whose entire product is not losing enquiries.
// It was replaced with a visibly disabled placeholder, and now with the real
// embed. If this ever needs taking offline again, disable the fields and say
// so plainly. Never accept an enquiry the site cannot deliver.
//
// Same pattern as AuditForm.astro: iframe plus form_embed.js, which resizes
// the frame to its content. The script must carry `is:inline` — Astro would
// otherwise try to bundle a third-party URL it does not control.
//
// The `height: 100%` in the vendor snippet is dropped deliberately: it
// collapses to nothing inside a normal-flow container, because a percentage
// height needs a parent with a resolved height. A min-height on the wrapper
// holds the space until form_embed.js sizes the iframe, so the panel does not
// jump on load.
---

<div class="form-panel form-panel--embed surface-light">
  <iframe
    src="https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/rUXvMnmqnmSBoJczO6nW"
    style="width: 100%; border: none; border-radius: 8px;"
    id="inline-rUXvMnmqnmSBoJczO6nW"
    data-layout="{'id':'INLINE'}"
    data-trigger-type="alwaysShow"
    data-trigger-value=""
    data-activation-type="alwaysActivated"
    data-activation-value=""
    data-deactivation-type="neverDeactivate"
    data-deactivation-value=""
    data-form-name="Website Contact Us"
    data-layout-iframe-id="inline-rUXvMnmqnmSBoJczO6nW"
    data-form-id="rUXvMnmqnmSBoJczO6nW"
    title="Website Contact Us"
  ></iframe>
  <script is:inline src="https://link.msgsndr.com/js/form_embed.js"></script>
</div>

<style>
  .form-panel--embed {
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    /* Holds the panel's height until the embed script measures the form, so
       the surrounding layout does not shift when it loads. */
    min-height: 620px;
  }

  .form-panel--embed iframe {
    display: block;
    min-height: 580px;
  }
</style>
